  "proposed_rules": [
    "Declare immediately on 8+ unseen waits: LuckyJ did so 93.6% (n=438).",
    "Treat <=3 unseen waits as the main damaten zone: first-chance riichi only 36.1% (n=1110).",
    "With a bad wait and a 10k+ first-place lead, bias damaten: declare 35.2% (n=145).",
    "Late riichi is still live: on turn 12+ LuckyJ declared 56.5% (n=772) when first offered.",
    "If the first riichi is declined, expect damaten more than a delayed stick: later riichi 22.1%, stayed damaten 59.4%, broke/folded 18.5% (n=1111).",
    "For late keiten, 2+ shanten under riichi stops pushing: 2+|5-0|riichi pushed >5% danger 25.2% (n=831).",
    "Once LuckyJ folds with two <1% tiles while 2+ shanten under riichi, it stays folded 52.4% of the time (later >5% push 47.6%, n=1141).",
    "When LuckyJ declares into an existing threat, the stick tile itself is >10% danger 42.9% of the time (n=830)."
  ]
